++ *
++ * <h2>Two enforcement modes, and the difference matters</h2>
++ *
++ * <ul>
++ *   <li>{@link #checkWrite} is <b>scoped</b>: it consults whatever the current
++ *       invocation declared, and does nothing when nothing declared anything.</li>
